<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Republic reaffirms Anglovaal Ind ratings.</title>
<headline>Republic reaffirms Anglovaal Ind ratings.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Republic Ratings said on Monday it had reaffirmed its long- and short-term ratings for Anglovaal Industries Ltd of AA- and A.1+ respectively.</p>
<p>Republic director Dave King said AVI was one of only 10 South African industrial companies to qualify for a rating in the AA band, indicating an organisation &quot;with a very strong capacity to timeously honour its debt obigation&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
